OL,3,ATrump says men arrested over RAF
OL,4,AFairford incident had been 'under view
OL,5,Afor a long time'
OL,6,
OL,7,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,8,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,9,Fmilitary. The country's Air Force says
OL,10,Fit "remains vigilant" following the
OL,11,Fincident
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/41
