OL,3,A'Scourge' of abuse must be rooted out,
OL,4,Asays Pope, during Lourdes visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 2021 inquiry found that clergy or lay
OL,7,Fmembers of the Church had abused about
OL,8,F330,000 people as children in France
OL,9,Fover 70 years.
OL,11,FThe Pope said Mass in front of
OL,12,Fthousands of worshippers in Lourdes,
OL,13,Fbefore he was scheduled to meet
OL,14,Fsurvivors of abuse privately later.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/41
